# What BackSpace sends is the host's setting: BS (0x08) at the reference
# host's start, DEL (0x7f) once the host chooses it, and BS again
# (INTERFACE-vtium.md, The BackSpace key).
# spec: ADR-1000 input.legacy
# capability: key-backspace-del
size 8 1
key BackSpace
check
reply "\b"
backspace del
key BackSpace
check
reply "\x7f"
backspace bs
key BackSpace
check
reply "\b"
